  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 07188e3f7456fa04e800b45bddcd722b, type: 3}
  m_Name: DeadFox
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TM.Items.DeadFoxData
  description: 'This gentle creature once danced beneath the moonlight. Now, it lies
    still, its final breath spent for a moment of your hunger.

    A life of quiet
    paws and curious eyes, ended by a hand that will never know the warmth it took
    away.

    It never knew your name, never wished you harm. Yet here it rests,
    a small and silent price for a world that calls killing survival.

    The fox
    had a thousand paths left to wander, a thousand dawns left to greet. You gave
    it only one final sunset.

    Its fur is still soft, its body still warm. How
    strange that something so full of life should become so easily carried.'
  size: {x: 2, y: 2}
